  "description": "GIHBEH crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C85 H106 N3 O53 Yb9,C1 H4 O1,2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 9 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 9 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb5 (Yb) has 9 O neighbors; Yb6 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb7 (Yb) has 9 O neighbors; Yb8 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb9 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 17 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.649-4.398 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.82-134.63°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C85H106N3O53Yb9·CH3OH·2H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 15 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 8 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
